#env MBUI_WIN=1280x800
# The rail's places: 文件 (the sidebar the stations' folders), the chats again, settings (the sidebar its list, 外观
# its first page): 深色 there turns the app dark at once, 跟随系统 back.
timeout 60000
until 新建对话
tap icon:folder
until 主目录
shot 1-files
tap icon:chats
until 新建对话
tap icon:settings
until 返回会话
until 跟随系统
shot 2-settings
tap =深色
wait 1500
shot 3-dark
tap1 =跟随系统
wait 1500
tap 返回会话
until 新建对话
shot 4-back
